<title>JAPAN: Yoshitomi Pharm - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Yoshitomi Pharm - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 52.78		vs	   50.49</p>
<p> Operating	    6.65		vs	    6.37</p>
<p> Current		6.58		vs	    6.38</p>
<p> Net		    3.23		vs	    2.56</p>
