<p> Shares	    151 million	  vs	 144 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  4.25 yen	  vs	    3.75 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Yoshitomi Pharmaceutical Industries Ltd is a pharmaceutical maker.</p>
